src/sticker.png) are fan-art derived from the "Bongo Cat" meme (original cat
artwork by @StrayRogue, meme animation by @DitzyFlama). They are NOT covered
by the MIT license above and are included solely as part of this application.
All rights to the underlying character remain with their respective authors.

